    <string name="settings_display_body">How the game and the official PD2 launcher show on the screen. A change applies at once, also while they run. It is also in the in-game menu.</string>
    <string name="settings_display_fit">Fit to screen</string>
    <string name="settings_display_fit_body">What the game shows, its menus and the official launcher too, is as large as the screen allows. Its shape stays the same.</string>
    <string name="settings_display_center">Center</string>
    <string name="settings_display_center_body">Each game pixel is one screen pixel, in the middle of the screen, with black around it. Sharp, but smaller. If the game resolution is larger than the screen, Fit to screen applies.</string>
    <string name="settings_resolution_full">%1$d × %2$d (full)</string>
